          "unsound": [
            {
              "advisory": {
                "aliases": ["GHSA-wrw7-89jp-8q8g"],
                "categories": [],
                "collection": "crates",
                "cvss": null,
                "date": "2024-03-30",
                "description": "The `VariantStrIter::impl_get` function (called internally by implementations of the `Iterator` and `DoubleEndedIterator` traits for this type) was unsound, resulting in undefined behaviour.\n\nAn immutable reference `&p` to a `*mut libc::c_char` pointer initialized to `NULL` was passed as an argument to a C function that that mutates the pointer behind `&p` in-place (i.e. as an out-argument), which was unsound. After changes in recent versions of the Rust compiler, these unsound writes through `&p` now seem to be completely disregarded when building the `glib` crate with optimizations.\n\nThis subsequently caused all calls of `VariantStrIter::impl_get` to violate the safety requirements of the `std::ffi::CStr::from_ptr` function - which requires its argument to be a valid pointer to a C-style string - resulting in crashes due to `NULL` pointer dereferences.\n\nThis was fixed by passing the out-argument pointer explitly as `&mut p` instead of `&p`.\n\nThis issue has been present since this code was initially added in `glib` v0.15.0. The mismatch in mutability was likely missed (and not raised as an error by the compiler) because the C function wrapped by `VariantStrIter::impl_get` is variadic (`glib_sys::g_variant_get_child`), and the pointer in question is one of the variadic arguments.",
                "expect-deleted": false,
                "id": "RUSTSEC-2024-0429",
                "informational": "unsound",
                "keywords": [],
                "license": "CC0-1.0",
                "package": "glib",
                "references": [],
                "related": [],
                "source": null,
                "title": "Unsoundness in `Iterator` and `DoubleEndedIterator` impls for `glib::VariantStrIter`",
                "url": "https://github.com/gtk-rs/gtk-rs-core/pull/1343",
                "withdrawn": null
              },
              "affected": {
                "arch": [],
                "functions": {
                  "glib::VariantStrIter::last": [">=0.15.0, <0.20.0"],
                  "glib::VariantStrIter::next": [">=0.15.0, <0.20.0"],
                  "glib::VariantStrIter::next_back": [">=0.15.0, <0.20.0"],
                  "glib::VariantStrIter::nth": [">=0.15.0, <0.20.0"],
                  "glib::VariantStrIter::nth_back": [">=0.15.0, <0.20.0"]
                },
